# Local-only tooling. None of this belongs in the image: the screenshot harness
# and the contrast checker are for verifying a change on a developer's machine,
# and shipping them only makes the build context bigger and the layer cache
# noisier. Keeping them out here is the second guard; the first is that
# @playwright/test is not a dependency of this package at all.
visual
playwright.config.js
scripts
src/tests
*.md
